msgstr "鍛造兵器已完成"

msgid "Researching: %(percent)s%%"
msgstr "研究中：%(percent)s%%"

msgid "Research queued"
msgstr "研究排隊中"

msgid "Build a Forge to research weapons"
msgstr "建造鍛造所以研究兵器"

msgid "Requires a completed Barracks"
msgstr "需要已完工兵營"

msgid "Insufficient resources for research"
msgstr "研究資源不足"

msgid "Forged Weapons available"
msgstr "可研究鍛造兵器"

msgid "Iron Age research available"
msgstr "可研究鐵器時代"

msgid "Requires Iron Age."
msgstr "需要鐵器時代。"

msgid "Requires a completed Barracks and Bronze Age."
msgstr "需要青銅時代與一棟已完工兵營。"

msgid "Advance to Iron Age. Unlock Iron Swordsmen and the Forge."
msgstr "進入鐵器時代，解鎖鐵刃步兵與鍛造所。"

msgid "Unlock Iron Swordsmen and the Forge."
msgstr "解鎖鐵刃步兵與鍛造所。"

msgid "Improve the weapons of Spearmen and Iron Swordsmen."
msgstr "改良長矛兵與鐵刃步兵的兵器。"

msgid "Spearmen and Iron Swordsmen gain +2 hack damage. Applies to existing and future units."
msgstr "長矛兵與鐵刃步兵的劈砍傷害增加 2，現有與未來單位皆有效。"

msgid "Iron Age research cancelled: a completed Barracks is required. Resources refunded."
msgstr "鐵器時代研究已取消：需要已完工兵營，資源已退還。"

msgid "Cannot build: select a suitable worker and meet the age requirements."
msgstr "無法建造：請選擇合適工人並滿足時代條件。"

msgid "Units occupy the building site. Move them away first."
msgstr "建造位置有單位佔用，請先移開。"

msgid "Frontier Worker: Gather resources, construct and repair buildings."
msgstr "拓荒工人：採集資源、建造及維修建築。"

msgid "Spearman: Combat unit. Cannot gather or build."
msgstr "長矛兵：戰鬥單位，不能採集或建造。"

msgid "Slinger: Combat unit. Cannot gather or build."
msgstr "投石兵：遠程戰鬥單位，不能採集或建造。"

msgid "Iron Swordsman: Combat unit. Cannot gather or build."
msgstr "鐵刃步兵：鐵器時代步兵，不能採集或建造。"

msgid "Goal: destroy every enemy unit and building. The AI attacks after it reaches Iron Age."
msgstr "目標：消滅敵方所有單位與建築。敵方 AI 進入鐵器時代後才會進攻。"

msgid "1. Select Pioneers and right-click trees, berries, stone or metal to gather."
msgstr "1. 選取拓荒工人，右鍵點樹木、莓果叢、石礦或金屬礦開始採集。"

msgid "2. Population starts at 20. Each House adds 10 (50 wood). Keep building Houses."
msgstr "2. 人口上限一開始是 20，每棟房屋 +10（木材 50）。記得持續蓋房屋。"

msgid "3. Build a Barracks (150 wood, 50 stone) to train Spearmen and Slingers."
msgstr "3. 蓋兵營（木材 150、石材 50）訓練長矛兵與投石兵。"

msgid "4. With a completed Barracks, research Iron Age at the Civic Center (400 food, 200 wood, 100 metal)."
msgstr "4. 兵營完工後，在市中心研究鐵器時代（食物 400、木材 200、金屬 100）。"

msgid "5. Iron Age unlocks Iron Swordsmen and the Forge. Research Forged Weapons at the Forge."
msgstr "5. 鐵器時代解鎖鐵刃步兵與鍛造所，可在鍛造所研究鍛造兵器。"

msgid "Press Ctrl+P to hide or show this guide."
msgstr "按 Ctrl+P 隱藏或顯示這份說明。"

