msgstr "結束時代"

msgid "Epoch RTS: the age every Frontier Union player starts in. Earlier ages are granted at once."
msgstr "Epoch RTS：拓荒聯盟玩家的開局時代，之前的時代會直接取得。"

msgid "Epoch RTS: the last age Frontier Union players can research."
msgstr "Epoch RTS：拓荒聯盟玩家能研究的最後一個時代。"

msgid "Advance to Stone Age. Unlock the Barracks and Slingers."
msgstr "進入石器時代，解鎖兵營與投石兵。"

msgid "Requires a completed Barracks and Stone Age."
msgstr "需要石器時代與一棟已完工兵營。"

msgid "Advance to Copper Age. Unlock Spearmen."
msgstr "進入銅器時代，解鎖長矛兵。"

msgid "A step toward Iron Age; no new content."
msgstr "通往鐵器時代的一步，沒有新內容。"

msgid "Requires a completed Field and Copper Age."
msgstr "需要銅器時代與一塊已完工農田。"

msgid "Advance to Bronze Age, the usual starting age. No new content."
msgstr "進入青銅時代（一般對局的開局時代），沒有新內容。"

msgid "Copper Age research cancelled: a completed Barracks is required. Resources refunded."
msgstr "銅器時代研究已取消：需要已完工兵營，資源已退還。"

msgid "Bronze Age research cancelled: a completed Field is required. Resources refunded."
msgstr "青銅時代研究已取消：需要已完工農田，資源已退還。"
